{"id":"nb70f3678fe","headline":"Private sector lending drags as banks lean on State securities","summary":"Kenyan banks significantly increased their investment in government securities in 2025, with that investment growing much faster than loans to customers. Private sector lending has lagged as a result.","why":"Kenyan banks are the core of the domestic credit system, so their balance between lending and government debt shapes credit growth and sovereign financing costs.","category":"economy","event_type":"capital","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Nairobi","country":"Kenya","lat":-1.292,"lon":36.822,"region":"af"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Standard","url":"https://www.standardmedia.co.ke/business/article/2001559427/private-sector-lending-drags-as-banks-lean-on-state-securities"},"sources":[{"name":"The Standard","url":"https://www.standardmedia.co.ke/business/article/2001559427/private-sector-lending-drags-as-banks-lean-on-state-securities"}],"published_at":"2026-10-05T08:26:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"49825b8e59f6a2df","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-11T22:35:51Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-05T08:26:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-05T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"KE","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/bank-building-4785454.jpg","alt":"bank building (illustration)","credit":"Alex_vagler","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/building-columns-architecture-4785454/"}}